// For tests/canton_external.sh only: a participant that exists before Ostia comes, as a validator's does. Starts the nodes of
// network/canton/canton.conf, makes a synchronizer and connects the operator participant to it. It makes no party, no user and no
// package, and uploads nothing: that is network/external/setup.py's work. Only the operator participant is used; the other two
// are idle, and the test checks that no sidecar but the operator's is ever called.
nodes.local.start()
bootstrap.synchronizer_local()
operator.synchronizers.connect_local(sequencer1, alias = "da")
println("EXTERNAL PARTICIPANT READY")
